{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>תִּפְקֹד אוֹתָם.</b> He repeated saying <b>תִּפְקֹד</b>; I have explained in parashat BeMidbar in the matter of the sons of Kehat (Numbers 4:20)." "<b>לִצְבֹא צָבָא, etc.</b> But concerning the sons of Kehat He said only ״לִצְבֹא״, because they carried the innermost holy vessels — therefore He said ״לִצְבֹא״. Whereas in our case, they muster the host of the holy mustering, namely the coverings, etc., and the boards, etc., which are the host of the holy — therefore He said <b>לִצְבֹא צָבָא</b>; accordingly, they muster the host."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:06:01.845203924Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}